The deterministic grid auditor and its initial regression tests were adapted
from the user-provided pixel-art-qa-development-kit v0.2.0. Pixelwright adds
indexed logical-canvas generation, strict reusable profiles, batch inspection,
exact transparent-RGB policy, output preservation, provenance, complete cell
masks, packaging, documentation, and examples.

Pillow and NumPy are runtime dependencies installed separately. Their own
licenses apply to those packages; they are not bundled into Pixelwright ZIPs.
